<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Madge Networks said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Madge Networks said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has cut its rating for Madge Networks Inc to market perform from market outperform, market sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were down 1-3/4 at 4-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
